# 0007 — MiniMax thinking replay on a custom endpoint
# Why: MiniMax M3.x models must receive each turn's reasoning_content back on every later request of a tool loop
# (https://platform.minimax.io/docs/guides/text-m3-function-call.md). StarNet replays it only for the DeepSeek profile,
# so a MiniMax connection configured as a CUSTOM endpoint lost its reasoning between steps (an agent would re-read the
# same pages again and again). This turns the existing replay on for custom endpoints on api.minimax.io /
# api.minimaxi.com only; every other custom endpoint is unchanged (test/minimax-reasoning-replay.test.js).
# Apply:  git -C starnet apply --3way company/patches/0007-minimax-reasoning-replay.diff ; then restart the station.
# Revert: git -C starnet apply -R company/patches/0007-minimax-reasoning-replay.diff ; then restart the station.
